{
  "rationale": "Use a small sensor plant plus a motion-capability plant, then encode the exploration policy in compact specification automata. The policy gives clear priority to forward progress in clear space, uses short directed turns for side/front obstacles, allows one brief backward escape only from a dedicated front-obstacle recovery state, and reserves full_rotate for a dedicated repeated-failure state. Action states are one-shot in the specifications, while uncontrollable events remain total and deterministic.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate sensing and actuation in G; encode safe exploration and recovery sequencing in E",
    "Bias toward move_forward in clear conditions, use random_walk only as a secondary clear-space exploration mode, use directed turns for ordinary recovery, and gate move_backward/full_rotate through dedicated helper states only"
  ],
